                </a>
                <a href="#warranty" class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 shadow-md shadow-gray-300 dark:shadow-none border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform group">
